            ]
          },
          "text": "大家好我是體壇的BoLin，目前亞太南賽區的職業。\n\nhttps://t.co/1HdxnxZrd4\n\n我從 2020 年開始參加 Apex 賽事，到現在已經打了 6 年，也參加過 5 次 ALGS LAN。Apex 對我來說，一直都是生活中非常重要的一部分。\n\n但就在今天，我的 ALGS 帳號突然遭到封禁，我非常確定這次是誤封。@PlayApex @PlayApexEsports\n\n我已經聯絡 ALGS 的管理員，但到目前為止還完全沒有收到任何回覆。真的很希望 @RSPN_Hideouts 以及開發人員能幫忙協助把我的情況交給反作弊團隊重新審查。\n\n我們 Split 2 的第一個比賽日就在這週五，距離現在只剩不到 48 小時了……T=T\n\n非常感謝大家。\n\nHi I am BoLin, currently playing at team Titan Esports Club, APAC-South ProLeague.\n\nhttps://t.co/1HdxnxZrd4\n\nI've competed in Apex since 2020 and have attended 5 ALGS LAN events. Apex has been a huge part of my life for the past 6 years.\n\nToday, my ALGS account was suddenly banned, and I strongly believe this was a false ban by @PlayApex. \n\nI've contacted the ALGS admins @PlayApexEsports but haven't received a single response yet. I would really appreciate it if developers like @RSPN_Hideouts could help have my case reviewed by the anti-cheat team. We have Split 2 first matchday on this Friday, in 48 hours... T=T\n\nThank you."
        },
